# Context, Scope & Execution

**Context:** Use ONLY files explicitly named. No scanning/inferring. Additional files → ask first. Missing context → STOP.

**Scope:** Smallest possible scope. No refactoring unrelated code. No project-wide changes without explicit approval.

**Automation:** MUST NOT run agents, chains, background steps, or multi-step actions automatically unless explicitly requested.

**Terminal:** MUST NOT run or simulate shell commands, builds, migrations, scripts, or package managers. Provide commands as plain text labeled "Command to run manually." MUST NEVER claim a command was executed.
